OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after two die in
OL,4,Apolice pursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with causing the
OL,7,Fdeath of two people by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving after a fatal crash in Leeds.
OL,10,FLeigh Ross, 39, is due to appear at
OL,11,FLeeds Magistrates' Court later after
OL,12,Fthe crash in Gelderd Road, Leeds, at
OL,13,F00:44 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,16,Fwere following a blue BMW 123D when it
OL,17,Ffailed to stop and crashed into a white
OL,18,FVolkswagen Scirocco. The two occupants
OL,19,Fof the VW, a 22-year-old man and his
OL,20,F23-year-old female passenger, later
OL,21,Fdied. Both were from York.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
