OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after two die in
OL,4,Apolice pursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys, aged 16 and 17, and a
OL,7,F16-year-old girl who were in the BMW,
OL,8,Fwere also arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fcausing death by dangerous driving but
OL,10,Fhave now been released on bail pending
OL,11,Ffurther enquiries.
